{"seq":2,"slug":"select-fundamentals","title":"SELECT 查询基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/select-fundamentals","wordCount":828,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"select-查询基础\">SELECT 查询基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SELECT 是 SQL 中最常用的语句，也是数据查询的核心。一条 SELECT 语句的执行遵循严格的逻辑处理顺序，理解这个顺序是写出正确 SQL 的基础。注意：SQL 的逻辑处理顺序与书写顺序完全不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;1. FROM / JOIN&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2. WHERE&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3. GROUP BY&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;4. HAVING&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;5. SELECT&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;6. DISTINCT&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;7. ORDER BY&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;8. LIMIT / OFFSET&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 书写顺序&#10;        I[&quot;SELECT → FROM → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → ORDER BY → LIMIT&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[\"1. FROM / JOIN\"] --&gt; B[\"2. WHERE\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3. GROUP BY\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"4. HAVING\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"5. SELECT\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"6. DISTINCT\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"7. ORDER BY\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"8. LIMIT / OFFSET\"]\n\n    subgraph 书写顺序\n        I[\"SELECT → FROM → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → ORDER BY → LIMIT\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句</th>\n<th>执行顺序</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>可引用的别名</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FROM</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>确定数据源和连接</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WHERE</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>行级过滤（聚合前）</td>\n<td>表别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GROUP BY</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>分组</td>\n<td>表别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HAVING</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>组级过滤（聚合后）</td>\n<td>表别名、聚合结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SELECT</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>计算输出列</td>\n<td>表别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DISTINCT</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>去重</td>\n<td>SELECT 别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>SELECT 别名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIMIT</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>限制返回行数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"列选择与表达式\">列选择与表达式</h2><p>SELECT 子句不仅用于选择列，还可以包含表达式、函数调用和条件逻辑。CASE 表达式是 SQL 中实现条件分支的标准方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const basicSelect = `&#10;SELECT &#10;    user_id,&#10;    username,&#10;    email,&#10;    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM created_at) AS register_year,&#10;    CASE &#10;        WHEN status = 0 THEN &#39;禁用&#39;&#10;        WHEN status = 1 THEN &#39;正常&#39;&#10;        WHEN status = 2 THEN &#39;审核中&#39;&#10;        ELSE &#39;未知&#39;&#10;    END AS status_label,&#10;    COALESCE(phone, &#39;未填写&#39;) AS phone_display,&#10;    LENGTH(username) AS name_length&#10;FROM users;&#10;`;&#10;&#10;// CASE 的两种形式&#10;const caseExpressions = `&#10;-- Simple CASE：等值匹配&#10;SELECT order_id,&#10;    CASE payment_method&#10;        WHEN &#39;credit_card&#39; THEN &#39;信用卡&#39;&#10;        WHEN &#39;debit_card&#39; THEN &#39;借记卡&#39;&#10;        WHEN &#39;alipay&#39; THEN &#39;支付宝&#39;&#10;        ELSE &#39;其他&#39;&#10;    END AS payment_label&#10;FROM orders;&#10;&#10;-- Searched CASE：条件表达式&#10;SELECT product_id, price,&#10;    CASE &#10;        WHEN price &lt; 100 THEN &#39;低价&#39;&#10;        WHEN price &lt; 500 THEN &#39;中价&#39;&#10;        WHEN price &lt; 2000 THEN &#39;高价&#39;&#10;        ELSE &#39;奢侈品&#39;&#10;    END AS price_tier&#10;FROM products;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> basicSelect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM created_at) AS register_year,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CASE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN status = 0 THEN '禁用'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN status = 1 THEN '正常'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN status = 2 THEN '审核中'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ELSE '未知'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    END AS status_label,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COALESCE(phone, '未填写') AS phone_display,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LENGTH(username) AS name_length</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CASE 的两种形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> caseExpressions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Simple CASE：等值匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CASE payment_method</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'credit_card' THEN '信用卡'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'debit_card' THEN '借记卡'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN 'alipay' THEN '支付宝'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ELSE '其他'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    END AS payment_label</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- Searched CASE：条件表达式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id, price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CASE </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN price &#x3C; 100 THEN '低价'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN price &#x3C; 500 THEN '中价'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHEN price &#x3C; 2000 THEN '高价'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ELSE '奢侈品'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    END AS price_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NULL 处理是 SQL 查询中的重要主题。NULL 不等于任何值（包括自身），所有涉及 NULL 的比较都返回 UNKNOWN 而非 TRUE/FALSE：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NULL = NULL</td>\n<td>UNKNOWN</td>\n<td>NULL 不等于 NULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL &lt;&gt; 1</td>\n<td>UNKNOWN</td>\n<td>NULL 不不等于任何值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL AND TRUE</td>\n<td>UNKNOWN</td>\n<td>三值逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL OR TRUE</td>\n<td>TRUE</td>\n<td>OR 中一个为 TRUE 即为 TRUE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COALESCE(NULL, 0)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>返回第一个非 NULL 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULLIF(1, 1)</td>\n<td>NULL</td>\n<td>两值相等时返回 NULL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"聚合与-group-by\">聚合与 GROUP BY</h2><p>GROUP BY 将行按指定列分组，配合聚合函数对每组进行计算。理解&quot;组&quot;的概念是掌握 GROUP BY 的关键——分组后，每组只输出一行结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const aggregationQueries = `&#10;-- 基础聚合&#10;SELECT &#10;    category_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS product_count,&#10;    AVG(price) AS avg_price,&#10;    MIN(price) AS min_price,&#10;    MAX(price) AS max_price,&#10;    SUM(stock) AS total_stock&#10;FROM products&#10;GROUP BY category_id;&#10;&#10;-- 多列分组&#10;SELECT &#10;    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date) AS year,&#10;    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date) AS month,&#10;    payment_method,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_amount&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY &#10;    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date),&#10;    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date),&#10;    payment_method;&#10;&#10;-- HAVING 过滤聚合结果&#10;SELECT &#10;    category_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS product_count,&#10;    AVG(price) AS avg_price&#10;FROM products&#10;GROUP BY category_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5 AND AVG(price) &gt; 100;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aggregationQueries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基础聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    category_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS product_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(price) AS avg_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    MIN(price) AS min_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    MAX(price) AS max_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(stock) AS total_stock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY category_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多列分组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date) AS year,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date) AS month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    payment_method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUM(amount) AS total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    payment_method;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- HAVING 过滤聚合结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    category_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS product_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    AVG(price) AS avg_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY category_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HAVING COUNT(*) >= 5 AND AVG(price) > 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>WHERE 与 HAVING 的区别是初学者常见的困惑点。WHERE 在分组前过滤行，HAVING 在分组后过滤组。从性能角度，尽量在 WHERE 中过滤可以减少参与分组的数据量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"distinct-与去重策略\">DISTINCT 与去重策略</h2><p>DISTINCT 用于消除结果集中的重复行。但 DISTINCT 的性能开销不可忽视——它通常需要排序或哈希操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const distinctQueries = `&#10;-- 基础去重&#10;SELECT DISTINCT category_id FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 多列去重&#10;SELECT DISTINCT category_id, brand FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- COUNT(DISTINCT ...) — 统计不重复值&#10;SELECT &#10;    category_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS total_products,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT brand) AS brand_count,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT supplier_id) AS supplier_count&#10;FROM products&#10;GROUP BY category_id;&#10;&#10;-- 替代 DISTINCT 的方案：EXISTS 通常更高效&#10;-- 低效：SELECT DISTINCT u.user_id FROM users u JOIN orders o ON ...&#10;-- 高效：&#10;SELECT u.user_id &#10;FROM users u&#10;WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> distinctQueries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 基础去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT DISTINCT category_id FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多列去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT DISTINCT category_id, brand FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- COUNT(DISTINCT ...) — 统计不重复值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    category_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(*) AS total_products,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT brand) AS brand_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COUNT(DISTINCT supplier_id) AS supplier_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY category_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 替代 DISTINCT 的方案：EXISTS 通常更高效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 低效：SELECT DISTINCT u.user_id FROM users u JOIN orders o ON ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 高效：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>去重方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DISTINCT</td>\n<td>SELECT DISTINCT col</td>\n<td>需要排序/哈希</td>\n<td>简单去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GROUP BY</td>\n<td>SELECT col GROUP BY col</td>\n<td>与 DISTINCT 相近</td>\n<td>需要聚合的去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXISTS</td>\n<td>WHERE EXISTS (subquery)</td>\n<td>通常更快（短路求值）</td>\n<td>半连接场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER</td>\n<td>窗口函数去重</td>\n<td>灵活但开销大</td>\n<td>保留特定行的去重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类型转换与格式化\">类型转换与格式化</h2><p>数据类型转换在查询中频繁出现，尤其在跨系统数据集成和报表生成场景中。SQL 提供 CAST 和数据库特定的类型转换函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const typeCasting = `&#10;-- CAST 标准语法&#10;SELECT &#10;    CAST(price AS INTEGER) AS price_int,&#10;    CAST(created_at AS DATE) AS created_date,&#10;    CAST(user_id AS VARCHAR(20)) AS user_id_str&#10;FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL 简写 ::&#10;SELECT &#10;    price::INTEGER,&#10;    created_at::DATE,&#10;    user_id::TEXT&#10;FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 日期格式化&#10;SELECT &#10;    TO_CHAR(created_at, &#39;YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS&#39;) AS formatted_date,&#10;    TO_CHAR(amount, &#39;FM999,999,990.00&#39;) AS formatted_amount&#10;FROM orders;&#10;&#10;-- 字符串函数&#10;SELECT &#10;    UPPER(username) AS upper_name,&#10;    LOWER(email) AS lower_email,&#10;    TRIM(BOTH &#39; &#39; FROM address) AS trimmed_addr,&#10;    SUBSTRING(phone FROM 1 FOR 3) AS area_code,&#10;    CONCAT(first_name, &#39; &#39;, last_name) AS full_name&#10;FROM users;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> typeCasting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- CAST 标准语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CAST(price AS INTEGER) AS price_int,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CAST(created_at AS DATE) AS created_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CAST(user_id AS VARCHAR(20)) AS user_id_str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- PostgreSQL 简写 ::</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    price::INTEGER,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    created_at::DATE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    user_id::TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 日期格式化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    TO_CHAR(created_at, 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS') AS formatted_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    TO_CHAR(amount, 'FM999,999,990.00') AS formatted_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 字符串函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UPPER(username) AS upper_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LOWER(email) AS lower_email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    TRIM(BOTH ' ' FROM address) AS trimmed_addr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SUBSTRING(phone FROM 1 FOR 3) AS area_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    CONCAT(first_name, ' ', last_name) AS full_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>隐式类型转换是常见的性能陷阱。当 WHERE 条件中对索引列进行了隐式转换，索引将失效。例如 <code>WHERE varchar_col = 123</code> 会导致全表扫描，应该写成 <code>WHERE varchar_col = &#39;123&#39;</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SELECT 的逻辑执行顺序是 FROM → WHERE → GROUP BY → HAVING → SELECT → ORDER BY → LIMIT，与书写顺序不同</li>\n<li>CASE 表达式是 SQL 中实现条件分支的标准方式，支持 Simple 和 Searched 两种形式</li>\n<li>NULL 遵循三值逻辑，任何涉及 NULL 的比较返回 UNKNOWN，用 COALESCE / NULLIF 处理</li>\n<li>GROUP BY 将行分组后每组输出一行，WHERE 在分组前过滤，HAVING 在分组后过滤</li>\n<li>DISTINCT 有性能开销，半连接场景中 EXISTS 通常比 DISTINCT + JOIN 更高效</li>\n<li>隐式类型转换是索引失效的常见原因，WHERE 条件中要保持类型一致</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SELECT 查询基础","id":"select-查询基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"列选择与表达式","id":"列选择与表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合与 GROUP BY","id":"聚合与-group-by"},{"level":2,"text":"DISTINCT 与去重策略","id":"distinct-与去重策略"},{"level":2,"text":"类型转换与格式化","id":"类型转换与格式化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据类型与 DDL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/data-types-and-ddl"},"next":{"title":"条件过滤与排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/sql-fundamentals/filtering-and-sorting"}}